4) A deployment causes DynamoDB performance degradation. What would you investigate?

5) Applications experience intermittent read failures. What would you verify?

6) DynamoDB costs increase dramatically overnight. How would you analyze them?

7) Global Tables replication becomes delayed. What would you investigate?

8) Queries become slower after schema changes. How would you troubleshoot?

9) DynamoDB streams stop processing events. What would you check?

10) Applications cannot access DynamoDB tables. How would you investigate?

11) Auto Scaling for DynamoDB does not respond to workload increases. What would you verify?

12) Hot partitions impact application performance. How would you identify them?

13) Backup restoration takes longer than expected. What would you analyze?

14) Monitoring alerts indicate abnormal read/write patterns. How would you investigate?

15) Data appears inconsistent across regions. What would you troubleshoot?

16) DynamoDB transactions fail intermittently. What would you investigate?

17) A DynamoDB issue causes a Sev-1 outage. What evidence would you collect?

18) Which CloudWatch metrics are critical for DynamoDB health?

19) How would you identify DynamoDB bottlenecks quickly?

20) What logs would you review during database incidents?

21) How would you validate DynamoDB resilience?

22) What testing should be done before schema changes?

23) What should be documented in a DynamoDB RCA?

24) How would you improve DynamoDB performance?

25) What preventive measures would reduce future incidents?

